# Working / session state — not part of the committed framework.

# Native agent working-memory (auto-created by the `memory: project` frontmatter).
# The committed, portable memory is .samantha/agents/<name>/MEMORY.md (the curated notebook).
# Slash-anchored at repo root only — a subagent run with cwd set to a nested
# directory (e.g. a docs subtree) creates its own nested .claude/agent-memory/
# that this pattern misses. Match at any depth instead.
**/.claude/agent-memory/

# Session scratch.
.samantha/scratch/

# Per-repo memory + working state — only the .example templates + .gitkeep travel.
.samantha/memory/MEMORY.md
.samantha/agents/*/*
!.samantha/agents/*/.gitkeep
.samantha/plan.md

# Private deployment map (local paths / site customizations) — not for the public tree.
.samantha/DEPLOYMENTS.md

# Editor / OS junk
*.code-workspace
.DS_Store
